---
import { siteConfig } from "../config";
---

<section id="services" class="p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-16 lg:p-24">
  <div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-16 items-start">
      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl xl:text-7xl font-bold text-gray-900">
          Services
        </h2>
        <div
          class="w-[75px] h-[5px] mt-2 rounded-full"
          style={`background-color: ${siteConfig.accentColor}`}
        />
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-6">
        <article class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">1. Power BI Report Development &amp; Optimization</h3>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Translating complex business inquiries into fully operational, enterprise-grade reports that teams actually love to use. Whether building from scratch or diagnosing existing setups, I eliminate performance bottlenecks to keep your reporting fast, responsive, and efficient.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">2. AI-Ready Semantic Modelling</h3>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Capturing your specific business logic within robust, reusable semantic models (data models, relationships, and advanced DAX). I ensure you stop reinventing the wheel with disconnected reports, establishing a single source of truth that is fully optimized and primed for AI integration.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">3. Data Storytelling &amp; Bespoke Visuals</h3>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Most dashboards fail on adoption, not data. I design interfaces rooted in cognitive psychology principles to speed up insight discovery. When standard charts fall short, I develop custom visuals tailored precisely to your requirements using HTML/CSS, D3.js, and Python.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">4. Cloud Data Analytics &amp; Data Marts</h3>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            For data challenges that go beyond the dashboard layer. I write optimized queries, clean raw datasets, and structure them into clean data marts and 'golden layers'--delivering seamless analytics across both Databricks and Microsoft Fabric.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">5. Advanced Analytics &amp; Deep-Dive Research</h3>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            For complex business questions that go far beyond standard operational dashboards. Utilizing Python and SQL, I run deep-dive research projects to extract actionable statistical truths. I help you solve high-impact puzzles, such as uncovering the underlying drivers of customer churn or calculating exactly how external variables like weather anomalies impact your sales performance.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-4 sm:p-5 md:p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">6. Fabric &amp; Power BI Architecture &amp; Governance</h3>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Setting up and maintaining what happens behind the curtain. From workspace tenant settings and strict security implementation to deep-dive health checks across your Fabric and Power BI environments, ensuring your platform remains highly performant, secure, and manageable as your organization scales.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
